      "content": "that's a really strong explanation. i'm thinking about how to structure the debate section of the lesson though. some people or economists argue that these wealth gaps are more about individual financial decisions or general market forces rather than these systemic designs. how should i frame those counter-arguments in the guide so the students get a full picture?",
